v2.8.9
Redirected project/update URLs to the gvp9000 GitHub / GitHub Pages fork.
Disabled Bioruebe feedback, statistics, privacy, and get-url endpoints.
Disabled anonymous usage statistics completely and removed the preference checkbox.
Changed settings behavior to prefer the program folder, with fallback to %AppData%\UniExtract.
Changed logs to prefer program folder\log\, with %AppData%\UniExtract\log\ fallback if not writable.
Fixed stale INI path reuse for batchqueue and filescanlogfile.
Updated file.exe usage to explicitly load magic.mgc.
Added WiX/Burn detection and prioritized Dark/WiX extraction before 7z fallback.
Improved InstallShield handling:
    - detects data*.cab + .hdr sets before generic CAB handling,
    - improves ISx fallback cleanup,
    - tries stage-2 extraction of payload-sized *_ext.bin with 7z.
Fixed batch queue race risk by removing the queue item before launching the next item.
Fixed wrong-password-then-correct-password case so final success is not treated as failure.
Disabled the old h4sh3m/Thinstall plugin path and removed it from plugin listing.
Improved Arabic/Farsi/Hebrew UI layout handling without mirroring the whole GUI.